return {
    ["\n1.每个人非肉体的部分分为四层，最核心叫精神体，也就是每个人最根本的灵性，万物有灵派认为，凡是生物都有灵性，都有精神体。\n2.精神体之外是星灵体，它是前者与灵界、与星空沟通的方式，属于前者的外在表现，和你当前的情绪直接相关，也是占卜的根源。\n3.再往外是心智体，与肉体结合。它牵涉头脑，属于你推理能力、思考能力、洞察能力和认识事物能力的综合呈现。\n4.最外层是以太体，它是你生命能量和肉体状态的表现，你看到的气场颜色就是以太体的外显象征。"] = "\n1. The non-physical part of everyone is divided into four layers. The core is called the spirit body, which is everyone's fundamental spirituality. The School of Thought of All Things Having Spirit believes that all living things have spirituality and a spirit body.\n2. Outside the spirit body is the astral body. It is the way the former communicates with the Spirit World and the starry sky. It belongs to the external manifestation of the former and is directly related to your current emotions. It is also the root of divination.\n3. Further out is the mental body, which is combined with the physical body. It involves the brain and belongs to the comprehensive presentation of your reasoning ability, thinking ability, insight, and ability to understand things.\n4. The outermost layer is the ether body, which is the manifestation of your life energy and physical state. The aura color you see is the external symbol of the ether body.",
