    ["<Title_HW>一月三日</>\n　　当初的选择还是太草率了，现在看来，不管是<InvHighlight_HW>学徒</>，还是<InvHighlight_HW>占卜家</>，<InvHighlight_HW>偷盗者</>，都更加好。\n　　　　可惜，没办法再回头了。\n<Title_HW>一月四日</>\n　　为什么我的孩子们会那么蠢！我说过一万遍了，不要被那些神棍忽悠。不，那些神棍或许自己也被忽悠了。\n　　魔药的关键不是掌握，是消化；不是挖掘，是扮演。而魔药的名称也不仅仅是核心象征，还是具体意象，更是消化的钥匙。\n　　……"] = "<Title_HW> January 3 </> \n The initial choice was too rash. Looking at it now, whether it is <InvHighlight_HW> Apprentice, </> or <InvHighlight_HW> Seer, </> <InvHighlight_HW> Marauder, </> would have been better. \n Unfortunately, there is no way to turn back. \n <Title_HW> January 4 </> \n Why are my children so stupid! I have said it ten thousand times, do not be fooled by those charlatans. No, perhaps those charlatans were fooled themselves. \n The key to potions is not mastery, but digestion; not digging, but Acting. And the name of the potion is not only the core symbol, but also the concrete imagery, and even more so, the key to digestion. \n ...",
